{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_006_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:39fc09f665c41a4cf779bfd510352bc3d7b845ec465f6edfea5f1e002cd43f0a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5725641799cd957410e87da1b2175689a65a003f1ef9085f7c8389fb34bc19",
      "text": "奔向偶像试镜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765a4a175fcaca5d21d0e7659d5eeb593c001a528f44ec32ceb930bd25cdbf7f",
      "text": "试镜终于开始了。\n在面试与实技中，英雄、龙、诚司各自发挥了\n属于自己的个性与作为偶像的光彩。\n试镜结束后，意气相投的3人\n决定一起去吃饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000022:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000022:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d5725641799cd957410e87da1b2175689a65a003f1ef9085f7c8389fb34bc19",
      "text": "奔向偶像试镜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6385699e276b22ae5e2372b14eadb7f11175d2d0e871432fe4290c9e46931a93",
      "text": "那么，各位。\n请坐到那边的椅子上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03a26d518f9e5f9c13a516a08bec61a31ac19ec9e0dc83175dff0355ef813a23",
      "text": "那么，请依次做个简单的自我介绍，\n并说明一下应聘动机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716c15fe2919075396dd997542f633828e919e7304edd6d15ea42f229fe73842",
      "text": "我是握野英雄。前不久为止一直在当警察。\n想成为偶像的理由是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d7fd45b38c152c3361bcb1ff317d6fd92e9dc5e11569f0b97c7a85db7c68a47",
      "text": "……我至今为止，亲眼目睹过许多因各种原因\n而失去容身之所的孩子们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c6fe28257916a504860b70f19230edaac6c245059511f5c16036e88b08c942",
      "text": "那些孩子紧紧封闭着内心，\n身为警察的我的话语，根本无法传达给他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c8261825a24baf22fcd851f838ddbb2150db90299b9cf524770bf8f8f91d805",
      "text": "但是……在大家身处的地方，\n总有“偶像”这一存在以及歌曲相伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ad3b9ace5747ac0e33eeb5d327164e71e1bbbdd66dae65b5e539ebbd4a9d3a",
      "text": "如果成为偶像，我的话或许就能传达给他们，\n说不定就能更加贴近孩子们的心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_006fra_03_1_1_006_03:1_1_006_03_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867b6bc06036e0d253692e4e43e42587401a0deab95fb0da097590d7a6131d91",
      "text": "为了成为孩子们的精神支柱，\n我想走上偶像这条道路。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
